WEBVTT

00:00:58.563 --> 00:01:01.563
"Cut! Cut. That won't do.

00:01:02.904 --> 00:01:05.686
We'd really better give
you a longer sound bite."

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.440
"How many words do I get this time?"

00:01:07.464 --> 00:01:08.880
"Well, you get two."

00:01:08.904 --> 00:01:10.636
(Laughter)

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:13.764
"Doctor Seligman, what is the state
of psychology today?"

00:01:15.607 --> 00:01:16.779
"Not good."

00:01:16.803 --> 00:01:23.803
(Laughter)

00:01:28.557 --> 00:01:29.729
"Look, Doctor Seligman,

00:01:29.753 --> 00:01:32.747
we can see you're really
not comfortable in this medium.